{
  "id": "E324",
  "title": "Where Are the Tissues?",
  "level": "intermediate",
  "date": "2019-05-12",
  "synopsis": "Many Chinese restaurants provide tissues for wiping your hands, but they might not always be free.",
  "audioUrl": "https://static.duchinese.net/documents/1040/c28619f570e1143eb13378bf3585615436688962.mp3?1556788589",
  "series": null,
  "fullText": {
    "simplified": "餐巾纸呢？\n\n保罗：小乐，这个饭店怎么没有餐巾纸？\n小乐：有啊，你等一下。服务员！\n服务员：你好，请问需要什么?\n小乐：麻烦给我一包餐巾纸。\n服务员：好的，两块！\n保罗：在中国，饭店里没有免费的餐巾纸吗？\n小乐：有的饭店有免费的餐巾纸，但是路边的小饭店常常没有。",
    "traditional": "餐巾紙呢？\n\n保羅：小樂，這個飯店怎麼沒有餐巾紙？\n小樂：有啊，你等一下。服務員！\n服務員：你好，請問需要什麼?\n小樂：麻煩給我一包餐巾紙。\n服務員：好的，兩塊！\n保羅：在中國，飯店裡沒有免費的餐巾紙嗎？\n小樂：有的飯店有免費的餐巾紙，但是路邊的小飯店常常沒有。"
  },
  "sentences": [
    {
      "index": 1,
      "simplified": "\n\n",
      "traditional": "\n\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Where Are the Tissues?"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "simplified": "保罗：小乐，这个饭店怎么没有餐巾纸？",
      "traditional": "保羅：小樂，這個飯店怎麼沒有餐巾紙？",
      "pinyin": "bǎo luó xiǎo lè zhè ge fàn diàn zěn me méi yǒu cān jīn zhǐ",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Paul: Little Le, why doesn’t this restaurant have tissues?"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "simplified": "小乐：有啊，你等一下。服务员！",
      "traditional": "小樂：有啊，你等一下。服務員！",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo lè yǒu a nǐ děng yí xià fú wù yuán",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little Le: They do. Wait a moment. Waiter!"
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "simplified": "服务员：你好，请问需要什么?",
      "traditional": "服務員：你好，請問需要什麼?",
      "pinyin": "fú wù yuán nǐ hǎo qǐng wèn xū yào shén me",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Waiter: Hi! How can I help?"
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "simplified": "小乐：麻烦给我一包餐巾纸。",
      "traditional": "小樂：麻煩給我一包餐巾紙。",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo lè má fan gěi wǒ yì bāo cān jīn zhǐ",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little Le: Can I trouble you for a pack of tissues."
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "simplified": "服务员：好的，两块！",
      "traditional": "服務員：好的，兩塊！",
      "pinyin": "fú wù yuán hǎo de liǎng kuài",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Waiter: Sure. 2 kuai."
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "simplified": "保罗：在中国，饭店里没有免费的餐巾纸吗？",
      "traditional": "保羅：在中國，飯店裡沒有免費的餐巾紙嗎？",
      "pinyin": "bǎo luó zài zhōng guó fàn diàn lǐ méi yǒu miǎn fèi de cān jīn zhǐ ma",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Paul: Restaurants in China don’t have free tissues?"
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "simplified": "小乐：有的饭店有免费的餐巾纸，但是路边的小饭店常常没有。",
      "traditional": "小樂：有的飯店有免費的餐巾紙，但是路邊的小飯店常常沒有。",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo lè yǒu de fàn diàn yǒu miǎn fèi de cān jīn zhǐ dàn shì lù biān de xiǎo fàn diàn cháng cháng méi yǒu",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "simplified": "",
      "traditional": "",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little Le: Some restaurants have free tissues, but small restaurants on the streetside normally don’t."
    }
  ],
